SECTION      | KEY                | VALUE
----------------------------------------
META         | piece_id           | digipet
STATE        | menu_stay_open     | 1
STATE        | grab_pointer       | 1
STATE        | grab_keyboard      | 1
METHOD       | Feed                 | sh -c 'exec "$1/&.widgits/digipet/ops/+x/event_page_op.+x" "$0" "$1" --trigger feed'
METHOD       | Status               | sh -c 'exec "$1/&.widgits/digipet/ops/+x/event_page_op.+x" "$0" "$1" --trigger status'
METHOD       | Close                | CLOSE
METHOD       | Cancel               | void
